  "interpretation": "<ul data-start=\"1291\" data-end=\"1828\">\n<li data-start=\"1291\" data-end=\"1395\">\n<p data-start=\"1293\" data-end=\"1326\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px;\"><strong data-start=\"1293\" data-end=\"1324\">Normal / Background Levels:</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1329\" data-end=\"1395\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 11px;\" data-start=\"1329\" data-end=\"1395\">\n<p data-start=\"1331\" data-end=\"1395\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px;\">Metals within above ranges indicate <strong data-start=\"1367\" data-end=\"1394\">no significant exposure</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 11px;\" data-start=\"1397\" data-end=\"1646\">\n<p data-start=\"1399\" data-end=\"1421\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px;\"><strong data-start=\"1399\" data-end=\"1419\">Elevated Levels:</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1424\" data-end=\"1646\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 11px;\" data-start=\"1424\" data-end=\"1507\">\n<p data-start=\"1426\" data-end=\"1507\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px;\">Suggest <strong data-start=\"1434\" data-end=\"1504\">occupational or environmental exposure, contamination, or toxicity</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 11px;\" data-start=\"1510\" data-end=\"1646\">\n<p data-start=\"1512\" data-end=\"1646\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px;\">Specific thresholds (e.g., Lead &gt;20 &micro;g/L, Mercury &gt;50 &micro;g/L, Arsenic &gt;50 &micro;g/L) suggest <strong data-start=\"1598\" data-end=\"1645\">significant exposure requiring intervention</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 11px;\" data-start=\"1648\" data-end=\"1828\">\n<p data-start=\"1650\" data-end=\"1677\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px;\"><strong data-start=\"1650\" data-end=\"1675\">Clinical Correlation:</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1680\" data-end=\"1828\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 11px;\" data-start=\"1680\" data-end=\"1828\">\n<p data-start=\"1682\" data-end=\"1828\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px;\">Must be correlated with <strong data-start=\"1706\" data-end=\"1827\">symptoms (neurologic, renal, GI), exposure history, and confirmatory tests (blood levels, 24-hr urine, hair analysis)</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>",
